  "label": "tomatoes are mapped as both fruit and vegetable",
  "description": "The text 'proof you can be a fruit and a vegetable' is directly mapped onto the visual entity 'tomatoes'. The meme uses the tomatoes as the visual representation of the concept being explained — that is, tomatoes are both a fruit (botanically) and a vegetable (culinary). The juxtaposition of the text with the image creates an analogical mapping where the tomatoes are the entity being described by the text. This mapping is educational, clarifying a common point of confusion in food classification.",
